  notes: >-
    v0.9.3 release. Headline finding: retrieval@4 = 41/100 on free-form
    fact recall but v0.9+RAG = 0/100 generation, validating the
    parameter-scaling diagnosis at the 81M ghost-small rung. Ghost-base
    (~360M) is gated on rented GPU compute.
